OL,3,GNEWSAAmerican soldier arrested by UK
OL,4,Apolice on suspicion of spying taken
OL,5,Ainto US military custody
OL,6,
OL,7,FTyner was based at Imjin Barracks in
OL,8,FInnsworth, Gloucestershire, the
OL,9,Fheadquarters of Nato's Allied Rapid
OL,10,FReaction Corps (ARRC).
OL,12,FCounter Terror Policing said he is now
OL,13,Fin custody over suspected national
OL,14,Fsecurity and espionage allegations. At
OL,15,Fthe time of his arrest, Russia said
OL,16,Fthey had "nothing to do with it".
